OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as developer drops school   
OL,4,Afacility pledge                        
OL,6,FResidents of a Surrey village have     
OL,7,Fvoiced their anger after a developer   
OL,8,Fwithdrew a pledge to provide a new     
OL,9,Ffacility for a local school as part of 
OL,10,Fplans for a major housing development. 
OL,12,FBerkeley Group is proposing to build up
OL,13,Fto 600 homes in Effingham.             
OL,15,FOpponents of the scheme argued the     
OL,16,Fdevelopment on the Effingham Lodge Farm
OL,17,Fsite, north of Lower Road, would place 
OL,18,Fsignificant pressure on infrastructure 
OL,19,Fin what they describe as an already    
OL,20,F"constricted" village.                 
